                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "\\frac7{10}\\times\\frac{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{4mm}\\hspace{8mm}}}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{4mm}\\hspace{8mm}}}=\\frac12",
