        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac57$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac7{10}\\times\\frac57&=\\frac{7\\times5}{10\\times7}\\\\&=\\frac{35}{70}\\\\&=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$\nThe missing fraction is $\\frac57$; equivalent fractions also work.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
